  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the enabling conditions for the participant countries to manage the shared freshwater ecosystems of the Putumayo- I&#xc3;&#xa7;&#xc3;&#xa1; basin in the Amazon region 
To be measured by:
&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#xa2;	Regional knowledge management strategy providing relevant information for decision making towards conservation and sustainable natural resource use
&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#xa2;	Action plan agreed for shared management of the basin designed and operational
&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#xa2;	Share of targeted subproject beneficiaries  with improved livelihood conditions</narrative>
